{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19191","headline":"令狐相公自太原累示新诗因以酬寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"令狐相公自太原累示新诗因以酬寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞蓬卷尽塞云寒，战马闲嘶汉地宽。\n万里胡天无警急，一笼烽火报平安。\n灯前妓乐留宾宴，雪後山河出猎看。\n珍重新诗远相寄，风情不似四登坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}